 ## Quick Start
 
+### Minimal verified example
+
+```java
+import org.aspose.cells_foss.Workbook;
+import org.aspose.cells_foss.Worksheet;
+
+public class ReadmeExample {
+    public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {
+        try (Workbook workbook = new Workbook()) {
+            Worksheet sheet = workbook.getWorksheets().get(0);
+            sheet.getCells().get("A1").putValue("Hello");
+            workbook.save("hello.xlsx");
+        }
+    }
+}
+```
+
+This exact example was compiled against the source build at revision `2be25d979d1f3bf2875a1798aed62a16efab6619`.
